{'symbol': 'IR', 'date': '2021-03-08 08:30:00', 'title': 'INGERSOLL RAND NAMES CHRIS MIORIN TO VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': "DAVIDSON, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INGERSOLL RAND INC. (NYSE: IR) APPOINTED CHRIS MIORIN TODAY AS ITS VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS. MIORIN REPLACES VIKRAM KINI IN THE ROLE, WHO WAS APPOINTED IN JUNE TO CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER. MIORIN ASSUMES THE ROLE FROM HIS CURRENT ONE WITH THE INGERSOLL RAND EXECUTION EXCELLENCE TEAM WHERE HE HAS SERVED AS THE VICE PRESIDENT OF CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT SINCE THE MERGER OF GARDNER DENVER AND INGERSOLL RAND'S INDUSTRIAL BUSINESS IN MARCH 2020. “CHRIS IS A T"}